			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with umbrella CHANGELOG rewrite\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to 2d6e601a, bringing in the comprehensive CHANGELOG rewrite that restructures the umbrella documentation from a placeholder to a full Keep a Changelog format.\n\nThe rewrite adds: an introduction explaining Element as the fleet umbrella whose submodules are the actual elements; v2.2 documenting the bundled-electron correctness pass sync of Output and Sky; v2.1 documenting the Full Workbench Lift CHANGELOG rewrite cycle across Common, Air, Wind, Cocoon; and v0.0 for project inception. Submodule updates include Echo (CHANGELOG rebuild with full history), Grove (Keep a Changelog format), Mist (commit references and dates), Rest (Keep-a-Changelog overhaul), SideCar (narrative release history), and Vine (restructured for clarity).\n\nThis aligns the Element umbrella documentation with the prose-style CHANGELOG format established across other Land components.",
